<p id="S4.I4.ix2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.I4.ix2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Temporal: Gap between the vehicle non-idle time and passenger request time.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="S4.I4.ix3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><sup id="S4.I4.ix3.1" class="ltx_sup">⋆</sup></span> 
