<p id="S4.I4.ix4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.I4.ix4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Default: use default objective (Distance </span><math id="S4.I4.ix4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo mathsize="0.700em">×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S4.I4.ix4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;"> Temporal </span><math id="S4.I4.ix4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo mathsize="0.700em">×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S4.I4.ix4.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;"> Utilization) in first-level assignment optimization.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="S4.I4.ix5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><sup id="S4.I4.ix5.1" class="ltx_sup">⋄</sup></span> 
